                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                        "entry_id": "ffd4b144-25e1-30ea-8e0f-ec74ad3b78a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "schoon, gezond"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5aca1df2-5a6d-4d7e-a234-f3fd203d2480",
                                "sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                                "text": "Een hygiënische werkwijze is van het grootste belang in operatiekamers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae46505d-7a6a-48e5-911a-c8d96a7e0bc2",
                                "sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                                "text": "Veel klanten reageren enthousiast en vinden het een ‘superidee’. Een enkeling stelt nuchter dat veel drankjes ook zonder rietje te drinken zijn. Waarom geen metalen rietjes? vraagt een ander. Die zijn lastig schoon te maken en dat is niet zo hygiënisch, reageert de bakker."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77109533-ba01-402b-b0ac-277ea4482404",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffd4b144-25e1-30ea-8e0f-ec74ad3b78a0",
                        "source_sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                        "source_sense_description": "schoon, gezond",
                        "target_lang_word": "hygienisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hygienisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35b0bb13-600e-31fd-b168-d8c10552e569",
                                        "entry_id": "90b39810-143c-3425-bc9e-2fd616bda614",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "der Verhütung von Krankheiten dienend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55d6b979-5e2d-4b7f-b992-012fbe4d1203",
                                                "sense_id": "35b0bb13-600e-31fd-b168-d8c10552e569",
                                                "text": "Wer die Samen selbst züchtet, muss besonders hygienisch vorgehen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31b3fd74-1554-4aaf-b3c6-b02b6df76308",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffd4b144-25e1-30ea-8e0f-ec74ad3b78a0",
                        "source_sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                        "source_sense_description": "schoon, gezond",
                        "target_lang_word": "hygienic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hygienic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6036bc7f-9a52-3ea0-a2f4-771c9525efeb",
                                        "entry_id": "b0f31642-6d06-315c-9b64-da02fa36d2d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to hygiene; clean, sanitary, free of disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dd56da9-871a-30d8-9c1e-704c9a55dd4d",
                                        "entry_id": "b0f31642-6d06-315c-9b64-da02fa36d2d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Whose expansion is guaranteed not to cause the accidental capture of identifiers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dd4d6c2-b09b-4e6d-827e-9814b612333d",
                                                "sense_id": "7dd56da9-871a-30d8-9c1e-704c9a55dd4d",
                                                "text": "Of course, anyone with a Scheme background is probably howling at this point because they have a hygienic macro system that makes unintended variable capture impossible. Allowing variable capture when we really, really want it makes Clojure's macro system technically more dangerous than hygienic systems."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "98d38128-92fd-46b7-a50e-c85d4310dbba",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffd4b144-25e1-30ea-8e0f-ec74ad3b78a0",
                        "source_sense_id": "b828ec58-e74d-34bb-90df-921e14791346",
                        "source_sense_description": "schoon, gezond",
                        "target_lang_word": "hygiénique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hygiénique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3b2f1b2-fcc1-3802-b237-0ecefde1e0c2",
                                        "entry_id": "6b3d38b6-6d9f-31de-8e58-53f22f3fb7d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est conforme à l’hygiène."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3aca1fbc-2a1b-4fed-9216-7d51f677d4b2",
                                                "sense_id": "b3b2f1b2-fcc1-3802-b237-0ecefde1e0c2",
                                                "text": "Sous le premier rapport, le sujet devra s’abstreindre à un régime hygiénique particulier. Il évitera soigneusement les excès en tout genre, les habitudes mauvaises."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45f59d6a-592e-4d8f-b638-b86339f4d5c2",
                                                "sense_id": "b3b2f1b2-fcc1-3802-b237-0ecefde1e0c2",
                                                "text": "Grâce aux précautions hygiéniques prises, la santé générale n’avait point été altérée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3db7326-8c63-3b73-85c0-610138568b88",
                                        "entry_id": "6b3d38b6-6d9f-31de-8e58-53f22f3fb7d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui évite systématiquement la capture non intentionnelle de variable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Au sujet d’un système de macro-définitions"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35889dec-7683-44cc-91ff-af07374baf94",
                                                "sense_id": "e3db7326-8c63-3b73-85c0-610138568b88",
                                                "text": "Le langage Scheme possède un système de macros hygiénique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
